\_| The rune-stone hums the moment your eyes fall upon it.           |
  |                                                                   |
  | Your « find » spell worked: you searched many rooms at once,     |
  | and the dungeon gave up a path no torch had shown you.            |
  |                                                                   |
  | Etched into the stone:                                            |
  |                                                                   |
  |   "Carry me back to the corridor. A CRYPT lies hidden there.      |
  |    Reveal it with « ls -a », then step inside with                |
  |    « cd .forgotten_crypt » and approach the altar."               |
  |                                                                   |
  | (You need not move the file -- knowing the way is enough.)        |
  |   ________________________________________________________________|_
